# Doc structure

## Layout

```text
doc/design/              # versioned design trees
  README.md              # which cutoff is current
  v1.0/                  # cutoff through product 0.10
doc/roadmaps/            # versioned roadmap trees
  README.md              # which cutoff is current
  v1.0/                  # milestones 0.1–0.10
    README.md            # version index
    VERSIONING.md
    LESSONS.md
    m_0.1_mvp.md …
    m_0.1/p_0.1.1.md …
```

## design/

- Top-level `README.md` lists version trees (`v1.0/`, …).
- Active cutoff: `doc/design/v1.0/`.
- Do not keep a parallel flat `doc/design/00-*.md` set.

## roadmaps/

- Top-level `README.md` lists version trees (`v1.0/`, …).
- Active cutoff: `doc/roadmaps/v1.0/`.
- Inside a cutoff tree:
  - Milestone file: `m_<major.minor>_<slug>.md`
  - Milestone dir: `m_<major.minor>/`
  - Phase file: `m_<ver>/p_<ver>.<n>.md`
- Links from `roadmaps/v1.0/m_*.md` to design: `../../design/v1.0/…`
- Links from `roadmaps/v1.0/m_*/p_*.md` to design: `../../../design/v1.0/…`

## Required sections

Milestone: goals, phase list, overall acceptance, non-goals, status  
Phase: goals, scope, non-goals, tasks, acceptance, depends-on, linked design chapters, status  
Status values only: planned | in_progress | done | deferred
